{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01a068ed37cb77a39d5e64f1","type":"tool_result","content":"/testbed/HISTORY.md:293:The new `AgentSet` class encapsulates and manages collections of agents, streamlining the process of selecting, sorting, and applying actions to groups of agents.\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:297:- Methods like `select`, `shuffle`, `sort`, and `do` for intuitive operations.\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:305:shuffled_agents = model.agents.select(lambda agent: agent.attribute > threshold).shuffle()\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:315:- Fast modification and selection of cells based on one or multiple properties\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:329:high_elevation_cells = grid.properties[\"elevation\"].select_cells(condition=lambda x: x > 50)\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:466:-   Add support for select input type #1779\n4:# 3.0.0a2 (2024-08-21)\n6:In Mesa 3.0 alpha 2 (`v3.0.0a2`) we've done more clean-up in preparation for Mesa 3.0. We now [require](https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/pull/2218) `super().__init__()`  to run on initializing a Mesa model subclass, `Model.agents` is now fully reserved for the Model's internal AgentSet and we fixed a bug in our Solara space_drawer.\n33:**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/compare/v3.0.0a1...v3.0.0a2\n35:# 3.0.0a1 (2024-08-01)\n37:Mesa 3.0 alpha 1 (`v3.0.0a1`) is another step towards our next major version. This release introduces a name change from JupyterViz (jupyter_viz) to SolaraViz (solara_viz), to better represent the tech stack being used. It also includes two bugfixes also present in 2.3.2.\n54:**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/compare/v3.0.0a0...v3.0.0a1\n56:# 3.0.0a0 (2024-07-04)\n58:This is the first pre-release in the Mesa 3.0 series, which is still in active development. The `v3.0.0a0` pre-release can help active Mesa developers help starting to test the latest features in their models.\n91:**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/compare/v2.3.1...v3.0.0a0","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4953cc79-9ce3-4e65-86b1-b6983f0c4320","uuid":"33330c84-1fce-4692-8d04-d209cad572d9","timestamp":"2026-09-03T20:19:32.397Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"/testbed/HISTORY.md:293:The new `AgentSet` class encapsulates and manages collections of agents, streamlining the process of selecting, sorting, and applying actions to groups of agents.\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:297:- Methods like `select`, `shuffle`, `sort`, and `do` for intuitive operations.\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:305:shuffled_agents = model.agents.select(lambda agent: agent.attribute > threshold).shuffle()\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:315:- Fast modification and selection of cells based on one or multiple properties\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:329:high_elevation_cells = grid.properties[\"elevation\"].select_cells(condition=lambda x: x > 50)\n/testbed/HISTORY.md:466:-   Add support for select input type #1779\n4:# 3.0.0a2 (2024-08-21)\n6:In Mesa 3.0 alpha 2 (`v3.0.0a2`) we've done more clean-up in preparation for Mesa 3.0. We now [require](https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/pull/2218) `super().__init__()`  to run on initializing a Mesa model subclass, `Model.agents` is now fully reserved for the Model's internal AgentSet and we fixed a bug in our Solara space_drawer.\n33:**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/compare/v3.0.0a1...v3.0.0a2\n35:# 3.0.0a1 (2024-08-01)\n37:Mesa 3.0 alpha 1 (`v3.0.0a1`) is another step towards our next major version. This release introduces a name change from JupyterViz (jupyter_viz) to SolaraViz (solara_viz), to better represent the tech stack being used. It also includes two bugfixes also present in 2.3.2.\n54:**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/compare/v3.0.0a0...v3.0.0a1\n56:# 3.0.0a0 (2024-07-04)\n58:This is the first pre-release in the Mesa 3.0 series, which is still in active development. The `v3.0.0a0` pre-release can help active Mesa developers help starting to test the latest features in their models.\n91:**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/projectmesa/mesa/compare/v2.3.1...v3.0.0a0","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
